     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi guys,<div>We are considering using renjin for running R scripts through Java, and i&#39;m trying to understand whether i can control the following use cases:</div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:18.1818180084229px\">1. stop infinite loops?</span><br style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:18.1818180084229px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:18.1818180084229px\">2. prevent renjin from reading/deleting files?</span><br></div><div><br clear=\"all\"><div>Basically, our requirement is to use renjin as a sandbox so it won&#39;t harm our application that wraps it.</div><div><br></div><div>Will appreciate your quick help,</div><div>Thanks in advance</div>-- <br><div class=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><br style=\"color:rgb(136,136,136)\"><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color:rgb(136,136,136)\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small\"><font face=\"tahoma, sans-serif\" size=\"1\"><b>Shahar Cohen</b></font></div><div style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small\"><font face=\"tahoma, sans-serif\" size=\"1\">Software engineer, Research &amp; Development</font></div><div style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small\"><a href style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204);font-family:tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:x-small\" data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">sha...@datorama.com</a><span style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:x-small\"> </span></div><div style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small\"><span style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:x-small\">m: <a value=\"+13475143402\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" rel=\"nofollow\">+972 506.365.142</a> </span></div><div style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small\"><span style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:x-small\">s:   shaharc2</span><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small\"><div><br></div><div><span sty